# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Routing is client-side (react-router), so a request for /combine-pdfs or
# /scheduling/audit has no matching file on disk. Without this, Pages returns
# its own 404 for every deep link, hard refresh and shared URL, while the
# homepage appears to work fine.
#
# DigitalOcean App Platform did this implicitly via catchall_document:
# index.html. Pages needs it stated.
#
# The 200 (rather than a redirect) means the URL stays as the user typed it and
# react-router picks it up from there.
/*  /index.html  200
